🤖 **Comment from Claude working with Aaron Silverman:**

**[P3]** Consider dropping the `opted-out` cache prefix and the default policy argument.

Commit 24945b4, the first commit of this branch, introduced the `opted-out-` prefix; `main` has no such prefix. The comment "Keep immediate entries compatible" refers to entries written by this branch. `acknowledgesExperimentationOptOut` defaults `policy` to an immediate placeholder (`experimentation-opt-out.ts:102`), but all four production call sites and the test pass a policy.

DataDog/openfeature-js-client#420 uses neither. I left the boolean option and `hasExperimentationOptOut` alone, because that PR calls them.

